  "prefLabel": "Env-Wq 1509.06 Requests to Extend Deadlines",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wq 1509.06 Requests to Extend Deadlines.\n\n(a) An applicant for a permit who has received a notice of incompleteness pursuant to Env-Wq 1503.13(c) and is unable to provide the missing application component(s) by the specified deadline may request an extension of the deadline.\n\n(b) An applicant for a permit who has received a request for additional information pursuant to Env-Wq 1503.14 and is unable to provide the additional information requested by the specified deadline may request an extension of the deadline.\n\n(c) Each request for a deadline extension shall be submitted in writing through NHEnviro and contain the information specified in Env-Wq 1509.07.\n\n(d) Any request for a deadline extension shall be filed as soon as the applicant realizes the need for an extension.\n\nSource. #9343, eff 1-1-09; ss by #12342, eff 8-15-17; ss by #14472, eff 1-19-26, EXPIRES: 1-19-36; ss by #14656, eff 8-6-26, EXPIRES: 8-6-36",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-wq1500.html"
